c. facilities and infrastructure;
d. availability of communication, information, education materials, and modules;
e. service delivery including prevention of child marriage; and
f. synergy and coordination.
3. Procedures for provision of services for Families as referred to in paragraph (1) are carried out through implementation of comprehensive service provision for Families in realizing Gender Equality and Children's Rights in the Regency Area.
